    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d710">

                <pb facs="0853" n="759" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg759"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sanguily was committed yesterday to court-martial for another charge, and as
                    Aguirre and Carrillo had not yet been transferred to civil court, I have
                    protested in the name of the Government of the United States in the three
                    cases.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
